— 11 new messages —[l][er]

Yui: "morning... no wait, this is bad"[l][er]
Yui: "like REALLY bad"[l][er]
Yui: "come here right now"[l][er]

Rin: "Urgent. I need to consult with you immediately."[l][er]

Misaki: "nope. absolutely not."[l][er]
Misaki: "my uniform doesn't FIT"[l][er]

Rika: "An interesting phenomenon has occurred. Sending data."[l][er]

Hibiki: "Stopping by the dojo before school today."[l][er]
