Miu: "Senpai, please don't tell my brother yet."[l][er]
Miu: "please"[l][er]

#protagonist
(...Six of them.)[l][er]

I don't have the number of that girl from the other school. I've only ever seen her on the train.[l][er]
—But she probably did too.[l][er]

#protagonist
(—So they drank it. All of them.)[l][er]


