[chara_show name="furyo" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

A black uniform. A student from another school.[l][er]
She was leaning back against the gate pillar, arms crossed.[l][er]
—Those arms were twice as thick as the ones I'd seen on the train yesterday.[l][er]

#furyo
...Finally.[l][er]

#protagonist
...Why are you here?[l][er]

#furyo
I remembered your uniform.[l][er]

#furyo
Last night something like a cat showed up. It said "his type" meant you.[l][er]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#furyo
You're going to explain. Don't you dare run.[l][er]

All the phones around us turned toward us at once.[l][er]


