—Seven faces turned toward me.[l][er]

#protagonist
...![l][er]

#akuma
"I want a girl with muscles to be my girlfriend"—[l][er]

#akuma
that's what he wished, in his heart.[l][er]

#protagonist
I didn't wish for it.[l][er]

#protagonist
